      "type": "mini_coding",
      "title": "Write generic helpers for the weekly report",
      "description": "The Monday report at Chợ Sớm said the weekly revenue was NaN, because a helper typed with any accepted a misspelled property name. Write three generic helpers that take a callback instead of a property name: countBy (how many items per key, keys in order of first appearance), maxBy (the first item with the highest score, undefined for an empty list) and sumBy (the sum of a value over all items). The test runner uses each helper with orders and with product reviews, so they must be generic; it does not compile until maxBy and sumBy exist. It reads the orders and reviews as JSON and prints the report.",
